# Secure Healthcare Data Sharing Platform

## Tasks

- [x] **Planning & Architecture Design**
  - [x] Create implementation plan with architecture, DB schema, API design
  - [x] Get user approval on the plan

- [x] **Project Scaffolding & Docker Setup**
  - [x] Create project directory structure
  - [x] Set up Docker Compose (PostgreSQL, Redis, backend, frontend)
  - [x] Configure environment variables

- [x] **Backend Foundation**
  - [x] Set up Express server with middleware (rate limiting, security headers, CORS)
  - [x] Configure Prisma ORM with PostgreSQL
  - [x] Create database schema and run migrations

- [x] **Authentication & MFA**
  - [x] Implement JWT-based auth (register, login, refresh)
  - [x] Implement RBAC middleware (Patient, Doctor, Admin)
  - [x] Implement OTP-based MFA for doctors/admins

- [x] **Encryption & Key Management**
  - [x] Implement AES-256 encryption/decryption service
  - [x] Implement secure key management (per-record keys, master key envelope)
  - [x] Implement Attribute-Based Encryption (simplified)

- [x] **Patient Consent System**
  - [x] Consent CRUD APIs (grant, revoke, time-limited)
  - [x] Consent enforcement middleware
  - [x] Auto-expiration of time-limited consents

- [x] **Medical Records & File Upload**
  - [x] Secure file upload (encrypt before store)
  - [x] Record CRUD APIs with authorization
  - [x] Decrypt and serve files to authorized users

- [x] **Audit Trail & Blockchain**
  - [x] Implement immutable access logs
  - [x] Simple blockchain for tamper-proof audit trail
  - [x] Integrity verification endpoints

- [/] **Frontend (Next.js + Tailwind)**
  - [ ] Auth pages (login, register, MFA)
  - [ ] Patient dashboard (records, consents, audit logs)
  - [ ] Doctor dashboard (patient records, access requests)
  - [ ] Admin dashboard (users, logs, blockchain verification)

- [ ] **API Documentation & README**
